namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamWidgetPresenterComponentBase {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetPresenterComponentBase.h#DreamWidgetPresenterComponentBase
    src   "Abstract: LoadWidget is PURE_VIRTUAL, so an instance of this class asserts the moment it\nregisters. Without this the Add Component list offers it, and picking it there is a crash\nrather than an error. Add DreamWorldWidgetComponent."
    text  "抽象：LoadWidget 是 PURE_VIRTUAL，因此该控件组件类的实例在\n注册的那一刻就会断言。若没有此项，添加组件列表就会列出它，在那里选中它是崩溃\n而不是报错。请改用 DreamWorldWidgetComponent。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetPresenterComponentBase:GetNavigationSelection {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetPresenterComponentBase.h#DreamWidgetPresenterComponentBase:GetNavigationSelection
    src   "The focus ring of the tree this component hosts, made from NavigationSelectionClass (else the project's) the first\ntime it is asked for. Shown and hidden by the selectables it marks, while their player's focus is to be drawn."
    text  "此组件所承载的树的焦点环，在首次\n被请求时用 NavigationSelectionClass（若未设置则用项目中的）创建。它由所标记的可选中项显示和隐藏，此时需要绘制其玩家的焦点。"
    state machine
}

