DreamWidgetPresenterComponentBase:OwnedTree {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetPresenterComponentBase.h#DreamWidgetPresenterComponentBase:OwnedTree
    src   "The tree this component hosts: outered to it, held here and nowhere else, and let go by\nDestroyLoadedWidget. Never saved, never duplicated into a play session, never exported by Copy --\nthe class it is built from is what the level keeps.\n\nNonTransactional, with the rest of what the component knows of its tree. A transaction records\ntransient properties too, and an undo or redo that brought this component back, or took it away,\nwrote back the tree it held when the edit was recorded: one already destroyed, or none while a live\none stood -- which the component then never let go. Which tree it holds is the component's own\nbusiness, never undo's."
    text  "此组件承载的控件树：以该组件为外部对象，仅在此处持有，别无他处，并由\nDestroyLoadedWidget 释放。从不保存，从不复制进游戏会话，也从不经 Copy 导出——\n构建它所用的类才是关卡所保留的内容。\n\n与组件所知的关于其树的其他信息一样，为 NonTransactional。事务同样会记录\n瞬态属性，而让此组件恢复、或被移除的撤销与重做，\n会写回记录该次编辑时它所持有的树：一棵已被销毁的树，或在有活动树\n存在时写回空——而这棵活动树此后便再也不会被释放。它持有哪棵树是组件自己的\n事，与撤销无关。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetPresenterComponentBase:WidgetOpacity {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetPresenterComponentBase.h#DreamWidgetPresenterComponentBase:WidgetOpacity
    src   "Presenter-level animation forwards. These exist so a Level Sequence possessing this component\ncan fade, slide, and show/hide the whole widget tree without binding any widget: each setter\nwrites through to the root widget, and a fresh load replays the stored values. Opacity rides\nRenderOpacity (children inherit it multiplicatively) and the offset rides the render-only\ntranslation, so neither touches layout."
    text  "呈现器级动画转发。它们的存在是为了让拥有此组件的关卡序列\n可以淡入淡出、滑动以及显示/隐藏整个控件树，而无需绑定任何控件：每个设置器\n直接写入根控件，重新加载时会重放所存储的值。不透明度作用于\nRenderOpacity（子项以乘法方式继承），偏移作用于仅用于渲染的\n平移，因此两者都不影响布局。"
    state machine
}

